    "Krouton Accent Swatch": {},
    "Krouton copies everything that reads easily first, then goes back to the damaged areas one sector at a time. Sectors that never read are saved as zeros and listed in a map file beside the image (GNU ddrescue's format), so you can try again later, in another drive, or with ddrescue itself.": {},
